<title>ARGENTINA: South American weekly vegoil, subproduct prices.  [CORRECTED 21:33 GMT 17/12]</title>
<headline>South American weekly vegoil, subproduct prices.  [CORRECTED 21:33 GMT 17/12]</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>South American vegoil and subproduct export offer/bid prices at close December 13 as quoted by the J.J. Hinrichsen brokerage (in U.S. dollars per tonne, or basis nearby CBOT contract).</p>
<p>(Hinrichsen corrects entries for peanutoil and cottonseed oil).</p>
<p> ARGENTINA, FOB Argentine ports</p>
<p> Peanutoil  Dec 810/790</p>
<p> Soy oil    Dec 508/500 Jan 515/505</p>
<p> Sunoil     Jan 515/508</p>
<p> Linsd oil  Jan 490/480</p>
<p> Ctnsd oil  Apr 535/515</p>
<p> Soy plts   Dec +2/+1.5 Jan +2/+1 Feb +4/+1 May/Sep -25.5/-26.5</p>
<p> Sunplts    Dec 135/128 Jan/Feb 138/132 Jan/Mar 137/131 Apr/Jun 120/114</p>
<p> Ctn plts   Jan unq</p>
<p> Lin expl   Jan 235/232</p>
<p> Brazil, FOB Paranagua</p>
<p> Soy plts Dec +15/+13 Jan +25.5/+24.5 Mar +3/+1</p>
<p> Parana-Rotterdam freight was steady from last week at $22 a tonne FISTLO.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires newsroom +541 318-0655. (c) Reuters Limited 1996</p>
